# General build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
out/
build/
dist/

# Per-worktree Lean build drivers.  Serializing `lake` one module at a time is
# a machine-local necessity (see Analysis/FabiusFunction/AGENTS.md), and the
# module list is specific to whatever closure a worktree is currently building,
# so neither belongs in history.
/order.txt
/build_closure.sh

# Repository policy: package-local SHA256SUMS ledgers are abolished.
**/SHA256SUMS
**/SHA256SUMS.*

# IDE and user-specific files
.vs/
.vscode/
*.DotSettings.user
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

